'''Curling Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] that can be unlocked when beating the stage [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Parade of the Dead]] appearing on the '''3rd''', '''4th''', '''17th''' and '''18th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] increases its health and movement speed. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was unobtainable until the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.8 Update|June 14, 2024 Update Patch]].

